<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2003_7473.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser freündtlich willig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dinnst</unclear>, und was wir
<lb n="2"/>mehr ehren liebs und guets vermögen zuvor, Fürsichtig
<lb n="3"/>Ersamen und Weisen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">besonder</unclear> lieben und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freünd</unclear>.
<lb n="5"/>Wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glaubwürdig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">berichtet</unclear>, das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gesterigs</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dages</unclear>
<lb n="6"/>ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Brämischer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Dülchischen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befelchshaber</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-77" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ravenspurg</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="7"/>umbgeschlagen, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">knecht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geworben</unclear>, denen er gleichwol
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lauf</unclear> nit geben, sonder allein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wartgelt</unclear>, auf ein
<lb n="9"/>wochen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dreÿ</unclear> sich aufzuhalten, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschicht</unclear> die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werbung</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>innamen der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Cron</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-280" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hispanien</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">naher</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-311" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Mailand</placeName>, was
<lb n="11"/>nun darauß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erfolgt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gibt</unclear> die zeit, Wir habens aber
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">truet</unclear>. und nachparlich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">avisieren</unclear>
<lb n="13"/>wöllen, inn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürfallenden</unclear> sachen sich darnach haben
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zurichten</unclear>. Und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bleiben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachparlichen</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dinsten</unclear> wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethon</unclear>, Göttlichem obhalt unß
<lb n="16"/>allerseits <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befelhend</unclear>, datum <origDate when="1616-07-08" resp="#ner">8 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Julÿ</unclear> Anno 1616</origDate>.
<lb n="17"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-511" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und Rhat
<lb n="18"/>der Statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Lindaw</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2003_7474.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2003_7475.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2003_7476.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="19"/>Den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürsichtigen</unclear> ersamen und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weysen</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Bur-
<lb n="20"/>germaister und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rhat</unclear> der statt St. Gallen</orgName>,
<lb n="21"/>unsern besondern lieben und gueten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründen</unclear>.
<lb n="22"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">St</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></placeName>.
</p>
